ed timelines for buying from the Asia Pacific region.","quote":"We are starting to see some sort of delayed timelines even from APAC region.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=1331315a-c9a2-49de-a72c-e49067fafc01.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that the U.S. market is doing better and Europe is okay.","quote":"U.S. is actually better. I think Europe is also okay.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=1331315a-c9a2-49de-a72c-e49067fafc01.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Normalized EBITDA margin stood at 20.8% in Q2FY27 compared to 21.2% in Q1FY27.","quote":"• Normalized EBITDA margin stood at 20.8% in Q2FY27 as compared to 21.2% in Q1FY27, a decline of 40bps on QoQ basis.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f4c9bb5b-4e27-4273-aa6a-d8b91b0a6812.pdf"},{"claim":"EBITDA margin for the quarter was reported at 21.2%.","quote":"EBITDA margin was at 21.2%, while PAT stood at 17.9%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=1331315a-c9a2-49de-a72c-e49067fafc01.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"The company secured a new Partner Ecosystem Management deal with an APAC operator.","quote":"• Secured a new Partner Ecosystem Management deal with an APAC operator","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f4c9bb5b-4e27-4273-aa6a-d8b91b0a6812.pdf"},{"claim":"Subex won a new group account in Africa for deploying Fraud Management at 2 opcos.","quote":"• Won a new group account in Africa for deploying Fraud Management at 2 opcos","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f4c9bb5b-4e27-4273-aa6a-d8b91b0a